# Exclude dev/CI files from release archives (git archive --export-ignore)
# .claude/ is deliberately NOT here: in RAPTOR it is runtime surface,
# not dev tooling — the slash-command dispatch files CLAUDE.md declares
# authoritative, the skills, the agents, and the SessionStart hook all
# live there. Excluding it shipped release archives where every
# /command and the startup banner were silently absent
# (test_release_workflow.sh pins the inclusion; release.yml verifies
# the extracted archive carries the runtime surface).
.github/          export-ignore
.devcontainer/    export-ignore
.vscode/          export-ignore
.gitattributes    export-ignore
.env              export-ignore
*.patch           export-ignore
out/              export-ignore
codeql_dbs/       export-ignore
docs/img/         export-ignore
test/             export-ignore
conftest.py       export-ignore
